# are drawn (hand = three Plains; "that many" = 3). The exiled cards may be played the rest of this turn - Bot1 plays the Forest from exile as its
# land for the turn (CR 305.1) - and on its next turn: Bot1 casts the Lightning Bolt from exile for {R} at Bot2's face (20 - 3) and plays
# the Island from exile as that turn's land.

